# Databricks CLI bundle state.
.databricks/

# src/app/local.env holds the demo's LOCAL values and is meant to be COMMITTED
# to git, but a repo-wide `**/*.env` rule ignores it. Re-include just this file.
# (It carries no secrets - only the "local" flavour of the values the targets
# set.) Note: being committed to git is separate from being deployed - a
# `sync.exclude` in config/sync.yml keeps it out of the app upload.
!src/app/local.env
